<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-23T03:51:45.198Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:51:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis have intensified attacks on Saudi targets, launching missiles toward Riyadh and a Saudi oil refinery while the Saudi-led coalition intercepted multiple missiles and a drone in the Red Sea region. The coalition also reported intercepting three missiles aimed at Riyadh and a missile in the western region, and Saudi forces struck a Yemeni port, prompting Houthi threats to bomb key Saudi ports. The United Nations backed a joint coast guard task force to improve Red Sea security, and dozens of children were killed in Yemen amid escalating hostilities, with 918 battle-related deaths recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168830&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE1KMzFEclNGTmZzQ2ljUmtId2l5YWxVT1p3MGJNNmJhbUR2QmE0cGI0dF9IYjRKcmhIckFDOHRwVDVOZEx5a1BYUVc4aUxNYXF4bVp3VzJRaVM?oc=5&quot;&gt;chinadailyhk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOQlpfRTE2QmpDQUlJZW1sR0NNZTFmYko3QTZXUi1zT204bEstaktEVzVjMWhPOGljaW1yT1h5dkNvTHJPZnNhWGNLMmdOdldiSmd3VEI1cThtNW5rUjdhM0I4VWYzQkhwVXNTdExDd1VjOXAzcFExaXNkZkV2VFRtNExQeWljaHZJeC1Mbzdfbi00ZWVIZDZJU19JdnlCXzF1SUd0TmVfUTJtdGNvaUhJTUN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQb1VFeWM5Y1VQbEZvVy1PVl92Mmg0ZzVGclNndGpFUHFGQzE4WHgtYnhiMFhSYmlOa3UzVFJNaGQ0c1VkRVpHMnVyajBISkhmRHBOT3cxMGJpZHBUeHJUb3NxOE5tYkxneTZEazB6RGNFZkUxOTdEeFFTdWJHMENQamluVGxLUnpPRDdNMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Av